{"id":"asesinato","lemma":"asesinato","pos":"noun","rank":511,"glosses":["assassination","murder","homicide"],"ipa":"/asesiˈnato/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"asesinatos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-asesinato.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella presenció su asesinato.","en":"She witnessed him being killed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355120"},{"text":"Hubo dos asesinatos este mes.","en":"There were two murders this month.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586702"},{"text":"El asesinato es un crimen.","en":"Murder is a crime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611191"},{"text":"La familia ama mirar misteriosos asesinatos juntos.","en":"The family loves to watch murder mysteries together."},{"text":"Él es culpable de asesinato.","en":"He is guilty of murder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636426"}]}